==Icelandic==

===Adverb===
'''svona'''

# [[thus]], [[like that]]
#: ''Það er eitthvað að '''svona''' fólki.''
#:: There's something wrong with people '''like that'''.
# [[approximately]], [[about]]
#: ''Ég fór síðast í bíó fyrir '''svona''' mánuði.''
#:: The last time I went to the movies was '''like''' a month ago.

